        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>24\" C.C. Modern Square Shower Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 24 inch Center to Center square shower door pulls comes with everything you need for installation on a glass door. It has a modern design that exemplifies the sleek and clean silhouettes that are so popular. Choose from satin nickel, polished chrome, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-720-aca.jpg?v=1704354747\" width=\"483\" height=\"105\" border=\"0\" alt=\"24 Inch Square Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/24-inch-square-door-pull-sgs-sq2475\"><b>24\" Square Pull</b></a> for metal or wood doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the 24\" Modern Square Shower Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 24-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Length: 24\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 3/4\" (19 mm) Square Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 2-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Inner Contact Tubing: 5/8\" (16 mm)</li>\r\n<li>For 5/16\" (8 mm) to 1/2\" (12 mm) thick glass</li>\r\n<li>Hole in Glass Diameter: 1/2\" (12 mm) Minimum</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged as a back-to-back pair with mounting hardware for glass doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 door pull handles) for Glass Door.</i>\r\n</p>",
